/2023</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\">\n<p align=\"center\">01</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"454\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bachelor Degree in Any Stream in Any Recognized University in India with O Level Or Equivalent Degree</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Data Entry Operator DEO&nbsp; Advt No. : 02/2023</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\">\n<p align=\"center\">40</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"454\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate Exam in Any Recognized Board in India, Computer 8000 Key Depression Per Hours</li>\n<li>O Level Or Equivalent Degree</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Lower Division Clerk LDC&nbsp; Advt No. : 02/2023</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\">\n<p align=\"center\">09</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"454\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate Exam in Any Recognized Board in India, Computer Typing Hindi &amp; English 30 WPM</li>\n<li>O Level Or Equivalent Degree</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Security Guard&nbsp; Advt No. : 03/2023</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\">\n<p align=\"center\">52</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"454\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate Exam Passed in Any Recognized Board in India</li>\n<li>Height Male 167.5 CMS,&nbsp; Female 154.6 CMS</li>\n<li>More Eligibility Details Read the Notification</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Driver Advt No. : 03/2023</p>\n</td>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"121\">\n<p align=\"center\">04</p>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"454\">\n<ul>\n<li>Class 10th Matric Exam Passed in Any Recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li>Valid LMV / HMV Driving License.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\" width=\"125\">\n<p align=\"center\">Office Attendant &nbsp;&n